0057: def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
0058:     """List the colors of overlaid straight lines in their only possible bottom-to-top crossing order.
0059: 
0060:     Input structure
0061:     The background is the dominant color. Every foreground color is the visible part
0062:     of one full one-cell-thick horizontal, vertical, or 45-degree diagonal line.
0063:     Higher lines may hide pixels of lower lines at crossings.
