0017:     - For each marker's band, paint the left and right boundary columns with the marker color.
0018:     - Paint the marker's own row across the full width; also paint the top or bottom grid edge when the band touches it.
0019: 
0020:     Key insight
0021:     - The single pixels are row anchors for full-width frames: each color owns the rows vertically closest to its marker.
